        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>《快排与间隔发车》 Page-4</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ma+Shan+Zheng&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;700&display=swap');\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', 'SimSun', sans-serif;\n    background: #f7f3e9;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    padding: 20px 30px 40px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    max-width: 820px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .page-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .star {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .problem-head {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .example {\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 1.5em;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .analysis {\n    margin: 8px 0 8px 0.5em;\n  }\n  .analysis-item {\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 1.2em;\n  }\n  .formula-block {\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 3em;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .eq-line {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .eq-label {\n    min-width: 1.5em;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .red-note {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n  }\n  .solution {\n    margin: 12px 0 8px 0.5em;\n  }\n  .sol-steps {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 2em;\n    font-family: 'Courier New', 'Noto Sans SC', monospace;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n  }\n  .answer {\n    margin: 10px 0 10px 0.5em;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .note-box {\n    margin: 8px 0 10px 1.5em;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 1.5em;\n  }\n  .double-indent {\n    margin-left: 3em;\n  }\n  .math-row {\n    margin: 3px 0 3px 2.5em;\n  }\n  hr.sep {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #aaa;\n    margin: 18px 0;\n  }\n  .circled {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.5px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 1.3em;\n    height: 1.3em;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.2em;\n    font-size: 0.9em;\n    margin-right: 3px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-title\">《快排与间隔发车》 Page-4</div>\n\n<!-- ========== First Problem ========== -->\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"problem-head\">\n    <span class=\"star\">★</span>刚巧相遇题时，以“车间距始终固定不变”为依据来建立等量关系。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"example\">\n    <strong>例：</strong>A步行速度为60米/分，A发现每隔15分钟就会有一辆1路公交车追上他，而每隔10分钟就与一辆迎面开来的1路公交车相遇。求1路公交车间隔发车的时间。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"analysis\">\n    <strong>分析：</strong><span class=\"circled\">①</span>无论是后面开来的，还是迎面开来的，都是1路公交车，即：车间距始终相等。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"analysis-item\">\n    <span class=\"circled\">②</span>从后面追来的：人车间距：\\( S_{\\text{追}} = \\)车间距\\( = V_{\\text{差}} \\cdot t_{\\text{追及间隔}} \\)\n    <div class=\"formula-block\">\n      等量关系 ← 相等<br>\n      \\( = (V_{\\text{车}} - 60) \\times 15 \\)<br>\n      \\( = 15(V_{\\text{车}} - 60) \\)\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"analysis-item\">\n    <span class=\"circled\">③</span>迎面相遇的：人车相向：\\( S_{\\text{相}} = \\)车间距\\( = V_{\\text{和}} \\cdot t_{\\text{相遇间隔}} \\)\n    <div class=\"formula-block\">\n      \\( = (V_{\\text{车}} + 60) \\times 10 \\)<br>\n      \\( = 10(V_{\\text{车}} + 60) \\)\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"solution\">\n    <strong>解：</strong>设1路公交车的速度为\\( x \\)米/分。根据题意，得：\n    <div class=\"sol-steps\">\n      \\( 15(x - 60) = 10(x + 60) \\)<br>\n      \\( 15x - 900 = 10x + 600 \\)<br>\n      \\( 15x - 10x = 600 + 900 \\)<br>\n      \\( 5x = 1500 \\)<br>\n      \\( x = 300 \\)\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n    即：1路公交车的速度为300米/分。<br>\n    车间距：\\( 15 \\times (300 - 60) = 3600 \\)（米）&nbsp;或&nbsp;\\( 10 \\times (300 + 60) = 3600 \\)（米）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">\n    根据“车间距 \\( = V_{\\text{车}} \\cdot t_{\\text{发车间隔}} \\)”可得：<br>\n    \\( t_{\\text{发车间隔}} = \\)车间距\\( \\div V_{\\text{车}} = 3600 \\div 300 = 12 \\)（分）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"answer\">\n    答：1路公交车的发车时间间隔为12分钟。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr class=\"sep\">\n\n<!-- ========== Second Problem ========== -->\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"problem-head\">\n    <span class=\"star\">★</span>若题中只给时间、速度的倍数，可设比较小的速度为\\( a \\)，再根据倍数关系求其他量来解题。<span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;\">（不建议设很小的速度为“1”：设\\( a \\)更有说服力；最后\\( a \\)被抵消时，才能更直观的看出与“\\( a \\)”无关）</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"example\">\n    <strong>例：</strong>A在马路上骑车时，发现每隔9分钟都会有一辆公交车追上他；A换出租车后又发现，每隔7分钟出租车就能赶上两公交车。已知出租车的速度为骑车速度的3倍。若公交车的发车时间间隔相同，求此发车间隔的时间。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"analysis\">\n    <strong>分析：</strong><span class=\"circled\">①</span> 公交车&nbsp;&nbsp;骑车的A，二者同向 → 路程差为车间距。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
